rwwi_stella_integration	1

description
	Stella document upload API integration - Cluster/FAT/Homepass Excel
	uploads via Basic Auth, JSON body. Split out of rwwi_astri_integration:
	Stella is a separate external system (own host), it only shared the
	astri jar/config for convenience originally.
end

requires
	base
end

requires_java
	rwwi.stella.integration
end

language en_gb
